{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":67732,\"title\":\"Woodsmith Shop\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"The Woodsmith Shop is designed to help you get the most out of your woodworking shop with helpful tips and techniques. Whether viewers are just starting out or have been woodworking for years, they'll find something new in every episode.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A2cT0MxCHTIBrZIve5hZj0nAizF.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":null,\"youtubeBackdrop\":\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/eDER6_ahod4/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":5.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"year\":2007,\"genres\":[\"Reality\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":19,\"totalEpisodes\":221,\"createdBy\":[\"Don Peschke\"],\"networks\":[],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2023-10-27\",\"cast\":[],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"eDER6_ahod4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"sbTreEJXMlg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"47ynSK5HECU\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":97655,\"title\":\"Classic Woodworking\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/goGYVomZXjqTJDLyRjLQ5TtxTEd.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.43529411764705883,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":61779,\"title\":\"Framework\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bd9kcH7xIdEH9q7SnD0bO2D8kBC.jpg\",\"rating\":4.7,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4227848101265823,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":2351,\"title\":\"TransGeneration\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cckeDldsr3JCFTp5hmyNRs5eLVX.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4206896551724138,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":327624,\"title\":\"The Reclaimers: Made in Suffolk\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nJAAREOpLJtULyDAPf5ngWd8y58.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42000000000000004,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":217695,\"title\":\"The Woodland Workshop\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eAJbnzDN6zemQ9fxLX26MRkiJvs.jpg\",\"rating\":2,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4076923076923077,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"Season 4\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A2cT0MxCHTIBrZIve5hZj0nAizF.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2010-09-18\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Craftsman Coffee Table\",\"overview\":\"The Woodsmith editors share tips & techniques for building a beautiful heirloom-quality coffee table with a glass top. Plus, you'll learn a quick and easy way to make mortises. All you need is a table saw - no chisel required.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-09-18\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Weekend Project - Candle Centerpiece\",\"overview\":\"Great looking projects don't have to be difficult to build. Learn the secrets to turning a few hours of time and a few pieces of wood into an elegant centerpiece that will light up any room.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-09-25\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Table Saw Jigs & Accessories\",\"overview\":\"Make perfect crosscuts and get tight-fitting tenons with your table saw. The editors of Woodsmith magazine show you how to build a couple of easy-to-build table saw jigs that guarantee perfect results every time.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-02\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Sawhorse Roundup\",\"overview\":\"Every shop needs a good pair of sawhorses. The Woodsmith editors present a couple of their favorites. They'll start with a traditional heavy-duty, trestle design with mortise and tenon joinery. Then, it's on to an all new stacking-style that locks together with tabs and notches.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-09\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Conquering Curves\",\"overview\":\"Learn the basics of adding graceful curves to your next project - starting with a graceful curved-front table, then moving onto a beautiful bow-front drawer, and finally a unique bentwood coat rack. The editors of Woodsmith show three simple techniques for conquering curves.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-16\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Ribbon Handle Box\",\"overview\":\"The Woodsmith editors pack a lot of woodworking into a small project as they share the ins and outs of building a beautiful box. You'll learn tricks for fitting a lid and getting super-strong miter joints. Plus, they'll let you in on the secret to adding a flowing, wood ribbon handle to wrap it up.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-23\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Hand Plane How-to\",\"overview\":\"See the tips, tricks, and techniques for getting perfect results with one or two small hand planes. In this episode, the Woodsmith editors take a look at a couple of their favorites: block planes and shoulder planes.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-30\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Blade & Bit Storage\",\"overview\":\"You can build these quick and easy projects to store and protect those expensive bits and blades in your shop. The Woodsmith editors show you how to store blades in pull-out trays, a wall mounted rack, and a two-sided case. Plus, they'll share simple storage solutions for router and drill bits, as well.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-06\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Router Jigs & Accessories\",\"overview\":\"A router is one of the hardest working tools in the Woodsmith Shop. The Woodsmith editors share some of their favorite jigs and accessories that will make your router work faster, safer, and more accurately.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-13\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Sliding Door Cabinet\",\"overview\":\"The delicate molding details catch your eye, but it's the unique sliding doors that set this cabinet apart. Learn the techniques for building flawless-fitting sliding doors as the Woodsmith editors build this classic cabinet.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-20\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Shop Storage: Slant-Front Tool Cart\",\"overview\":\"Keep every tool in your shop neat and organized with a handy roll-around tool cart. This plywood project features handy pullout drawers for plenty of storage, and screw together joinery makes it easy to build. The editors of Woodsmith show you how to make one for your shop.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-27\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Mobile Shop Cart\",\"overview\":\"A large work surface, heavy-duty construction, and plenty of storage make this a must-have project for any shop. The Woodsmith editors show you how to build this multi-purpose shop cart with easy-to-find, inexpensive materials.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-12-04\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Top Shop Tips\",\"overview\":\"In the Woodsmith Shop, we're always looking for ways to make woodworking faster, safer, and more accurate. See some of our favorite shop tips and techniques from the pages of Woodsmith magazine.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-12-11\",\"runtime\":0}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2007-10-05\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}